# Journal

## Purpose
Journal.

## Requirements

### REQ-JRN-1 · Record
status: proposed
The system SHALL record a line.

#### Scenario: record
- WHEN posted
- THEN recorded

### REQ-JRN-2 · Erase
status: proposed
The system SHALL erase a line.

#### Scenario: erase
- WHEN erased
- THEN gone
-- posting.md --
---
capability: posting
prefix: LED
---
# Posting

## Purpose
Posting.

## Requirements

### REQ-LED-1 · Post
status: proposed
The system SHALL post an entry.

#### Scenario: post
